\viewkind4\uc1\pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  Long time ago, some mothers brought  their children\cf0 
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   to Jesus for him to lay hands and bless them.
\par   You bless them abundantly, and we today,
\par   request that you give same to this child of ours.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Good shepherd adopt him as one of your lambs,
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   and take him as one of those that you have saved.
\par   Show on his forehead the glory in your name
\par   and make him follow you in all his life time.
\par 
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Our Father  Almighty, take Him as your son!
\par \pard\li144\sl190\slmult0\qj   Our merciful  Saviour, take care of His life!
\par   Let your Holy Spirit, come and fill him now
\par \pard     Give him eternal life on earth and in heav'n.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

